\n.sd-planet.us-weak{--_c:var(--sd-us-weak);--_g:rgba(248,113,113,.5);--_g2:rgba(248,113,113,.15)}\n.sd-planet.ember{--_c:var(--sd-ember);--_g:rgba(255,138,61,.55);--_g2:rgba(255,138,61,.18)}\n.sd-planet.neutral{--_c:var(--sd-neutral);--_g:rgba(154,165,184,.38)}\n/* 浮力標網格：六（三/二）格行星量表，逐格浮力上升 */\n.sd-buoy-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1px;\n  background:var(--hair,var(--border,#232a36));border:1px solid var(--hair,var(--border,#232a36));\n  border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}\n.sd-gauge{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:9px;\n  padding:17px 12px 15px;background:var(--ink,var(--bg-card,#0e1015));\n  animation:sd-rise var(--sd-rise-dur) var(--sd-rise-ease) both;animation-delay:calc(var(--i,0) * var(--sd-rise-step))}\n.sd-gauge .sd-planet{--_d:30px}\n.sd-g-v{font-family:var(--num,ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace);font-size:18px;font-weight:600;\n  color:#eef2f7;line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.sd-g-v small{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-3,#6b7385);font-weight:400;margin-left:1px}\n.sd-g-k{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--text-3,#6b7385);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\n  white-space:nowrap;text-align:center}\n.sd-mkt{font-family:var(--num,ui-monospace,monospace);font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:2px;font-weight:700}\n.sd-mkt.tw{color:var(--sd-tw-strong);background:rgba(74,222,128,.1)}\n.sd-mkt.us{color:var(--sd-us-strong);background:rgba(74,222,128,.1)}\n/* 浮力晶片（BUOYANCY 面板：行星 + 名稱 + 值）*/\n.sd-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;color:#cdd6e4;\n  background:#10131a;border:1px solid var(--border,#232a36);border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px 3px 6px}\n.sd-chip .sd-planet{--_d:13px}\n.sd-chip b{font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n/* 軌道/地平線（HORIZON 前方事件：NOW → 前方航點行星，可橫捲）*/\n.sd-orbit{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;\n  padding:16px 2px 4px;margin-top:2px}\n.sd-orbit::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n.sd-orbit::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:6px;right:6px;top:23px;height:1px;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--sd-ember),rgba(255,138,61,.15) 62%,transparent)}\n.sd-node{flex:0 0 auto;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;\n  padding:0 11px;min-width:58px;text-decoration:none;\n  animation:sd-rise var(--sd-rise-dur) var(--sd-rise-ease) both;animation-delay:calc(var(--i,0) * var(--sd-rise-step))}\n.sd-node .sd-planet{--_d:13px;margin-bottom:1px}\n.sd-node.sd-now .sd-planet{--_d:9px}\n.sd-node b{font-family:var(--mono,var(--num,ui-monospace,monospace));font-size:11px;color:#cdd6e4;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.sd-node .sd-t{font-size:9.5px;line-height:1.35;color:#9aa5b8;max-width:70px;text-align:center}\n.sd-node i{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono,var(--num,monospace));font-size:9px;color:#6b7385;letter-spacing:.04em}\n.sd-node.sd-now b{color:var(--sd-ember);letter-spacing:.14em}\n.sd-node.hot b,.sd-node.hot i{color:var(--sd-ember)}\n.sd-node.hot .sd-t{color:#e8edf2}\n.sd-node:hover .sd-t{color:#e8edf2}\n@media(max-width:760px){.sd-buoy-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:400px){.sd-buoy-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.sd-planet,.sd-gauge,.sd-node{animation:none!important}}\n@media print{.sd-planet,.sd-gauge,.sd-node{animation:none!important}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"con-posture\"><div class=\"con-tagcell\">TODAY<span>今日盤勢</span></div><div class=\"con-body\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px 12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:9px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#6b7385\">2026-09-13 週日 · 週末整理 · 09-10 版判讀 · 今日更新中</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:100px;border:1px solid #3a4150;color:#cdd6e4\">區間整理</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:100px;background:#f871711f;border:1px solid #f8717166;color:#f87171;font-weight:700\">氣壓 -1/6 偏逆風</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,.4);color:#f87171;font-weight:700\">● 事件風險 啟動中</span></div><div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#eef2f7;font-weight:500\">昨日「拔河」已在今日上半場分出勝負：Brent 守穩 101.24 美元，台股加權（TWII）盤中跌至 46,837（−0.73%），47,000 關口失守。費半（SOX）昨夜逆漲 +0.37%，外資早盤押注 AI 主線近 200 億台幣——但仍未能撐住關口；台積電 8 月營收今日是第一道驗證，明日 CPI 才是決定行情能否再向下一段的裁決點。</div><div style=\"margin-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #232a36;padding-top:8px\"><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#6b7385;margin-bottom:5px\">HISTORY · 過去盤勢（近 20 日判讀 · 可捲動）</div><div style=\"max-height:118px;overflow-y:auto;scrollbar-width:thin;padding-right:6px\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">09/09 週三</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">荷姆茲海峽升級為實彈戰場，Brent 99.45 美元叩關百元。但費半逆漲 +1.3%、台股 47,183 僅微揚——油價恐慌與 AI 資金流正在拔河，明天台積電 8 月營收、週四 CPI 是兩道裁決線。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">09/08 週二</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">台股加權指數 47,105.78（-0.47%）從昨日高點收斂，Brent 原油 $98.27（+2.07%）衝近 6 週高點、銅價據報創歷史新高——油銅聯漲把通膨疑慮重新帶回台面，美債殖利率已在 4.77% 的逆風位置。ASML 贏得 TSMC／Samsung EUV 新機台訂單、蘋果改簽 NAND 長約，半導體鏈另有催化劑在撐</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">09/07 週一</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">SOX 上週五衝 3.38%，今天接棒效應推著台股大盤開高至 47,338（+787 點）。但市場內部正在分家：聯電靠 8 月營收漲停，鴻海靠 AI 故事已波段跌 27%。9/10 台積電營收與 9/11 美國 CPI 是本週兩根驗證棒，哪根先折，今天的漲勢就從哪裡測試。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">09/06 週日</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">費半 +3.4% 至 11,735 驗收 AI 需求無虞，但荷莫茲海峽衝突把 Brent 推上 96.3、美債殖利率卡 4.77%，S&amp;P 反跌 0.4% 不買單——9/11 CPI 若被油價灌髒，分歧收斂方向就不妙。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">09/05 週六</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">博通財報引爆費半 +3.4% 至 11,735、台積 ADR +2.9% 至 428.9，AI 半導體獨拿全場掌聲——但 S&amp;P 反跌 0.4%、黃金 -1.4%，非農落地後大盤沒跟上，9/11 CPI 是下一個分歧裁判。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">09/04 週五</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">Nasdaq 隔夜加速至 +1.4% 把 VIX 壓到 14.32，台股盤中跳高 +0.62% 至 46,142.57——市場用風險胃口為今夜博通財報＋非農雙事件投了信任票</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">09/03 週四</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">VIX 單日跌 -6.98% 至 15.2、美三指各漲約 +0.45%，台股今晨翻正 +0.28% 至 46,294.47，Brent 在 95.55 略微喘穩；但個股分化（南亞科衝高翻黑、玉山金+5%）揭示今日是消化日而非反轉日</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">09/02 週三</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">荷莫茲海峽再傳油輪遇襲，Brent 由 88.57 飆至 95.57，費半 -2.14%；台股終場 46,164.72、−1.67%，台積電 -2.25% 同步承壓，9/4 非農與博通財報將決定裂縫是否擴大。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">09/01 週二</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">荷莫茲海峽油輪遇襲推升 Brent 盤中衝破 90 後回落至 88.57，但台股以 +1.33% 跳空回應 HBM 現貨價飆漲五倍與輝達—聯發科結盟消息；雙軸拉鋸的勝負手在 9/4 非農與博通財報。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">08/31 週一</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">本輪事件主軸偏向 AI / 半導體需求；大型科技和供應鏈仍有支撐,但高基期下更需要營收與毛利率驗證。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">08/30 週日</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">本輪事件主軸偏向政策、通膨與殖利率；風險資產能否續強,取決於市場是否相信高利率只是短期擾動。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">08/29 週六</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">本輪公開新聞未出現明確 CRITICAL/HIGH 主軸；事件風險暫無升級,但仍需等下一輪新聞與市場 tape 驗證。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">08/28 週五</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">本輪事件主軸偏向政策、通膨與殖利率；風險資產能否續強,取決於市場是否相信高利率只是短期擾動。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">08/27 週四</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">NVIDIA 財報過關、台股跳空漲 +1.78% 至 45,975，但主角不是台積電（2,410、近乎平盤 -0.21%）而是 DRAM——南亞科衝 555 新高、報價飆漲標題滿天飛；Jackson Hole 今天開幕</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">08/26 週三</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">昨晚費半反彈 +1.44% 至 11,588、台積電 ADR 收復 417，台股今日大漲 +1.47% 至 45,832 搶答 NVIDIA 財報；DRAM 本季喊漲逾 50%、荷莫茲海峽重開壓油價跌近 2%</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">08/25 週二</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">費半夜殺 2.7%、台積電 ADR 跌 2.1%，但台股僅微跌 0.12%、台積電逆漲至 2,400；AI 晶片走私起訴案與伊朗全面戰爭宣言同日疊加，明日 NVIDIA 財報＋PCE 是 24 小時內的唯一解答。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">08/24 週一</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">台股週一收 44,762（-1.02%），台積電 2,375（-1.45%）領跌；8/26 NVIDIA 財報＋PCE、8/27 Jackson Hole 三連發前，氣壓場偏逆風（美債 4.69%、淨空單 8.3 萬口），資金主動避險而非恐慌。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">08/23 週日</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">本輪事件主軸偏向政策、通膨與殖利率；風險資產能否續強,取決於市場是否相信高利率只是短期擾動。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">08/22 週六</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">本輪事件主軸偏向政策、通膨與殖利率；風險資產能否續強,取決於市場是否相信高利率只是短期擾動。</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed #232a36\"><span style=\"flex:none;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">08/21 週五</span><span style=\"font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#9aa5b8\">荷莫茲僵局連日佔頭條但 Brent 93.74 幾乎平盤，利空鈍化浮現；VIX 跳升至 16.01（+7.5%），市場真正在防的是 8/26 NVIDIA 財報＋PCE＋Jackson Hole 三重壓力測試。</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"con-panels\"><div style=\"background:#12151c;border:1px solid #2a3140;border-radius:12px;padding:11px 12px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;margin-bottom:9px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700\">資金浮力場</span><span class=\"con-eb\">BUOYANCY</span><a href=\"/sector_strength_tw.html\" style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;color:#60a5fa;text-decoration:none\">全版 →</a></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:5px\"><span class=\"sd-chip\"><span class=\"sd-planet tw-strong\" style=\"--_d:13px\"></span>塑膠<b style=\"color:#4ade80\">+20</b></span><span class=\"sd-chip\"><span class=\"sd-planet tw-strong\" style=\"--_d:13px\"></span>油電燃氣<b style=\"color:#4ade80\">+17</b></span></div><div style=\"border-top:1px dashed #2a3140;margin:6px 0;font-size:9px;color:#46506a;text-align:center;line-height:1\">水位線</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:5px\"><span class=\"sd-chip\"><span class=\"sd-planet tw-weak\" style=\"--_d:13px\"></span>生技醫療<b style=\"color:#f87171\">-9</b></span><span class=\"sd-chip\"><span class=\"sd-planet tw-weak\" style=\"--_d:13px\"></span>電子通路<b style=\"color:#f87171\">-9</b></span></div><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;color:#6b7385;margin-top:8px\">綠＝資金流入／紅＝流出 · 球高即浮力 · 更新 9/12 06:30</div></div><div style=\"background:#12151c;border:1px solid #2a3140;border-radius:12px;padding:11px 12px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;m